Mistgate includes a Go implementation of parts of the MTProto proxy protocol.
Its protocol behaviour is derived from Telemt 3.5.16 (commit
84e5b827a6619fb2e09ad3d09f253cdffe04bc2f), and the implementation is a
modified, unofficial work: it is not Telemt and is not endorsed by the Telemt
maintainers.

